scn 1
# Pinwheel U-turn (legion_world_test `pinwheel`, gap 0): 48 footprint-2 bodies
# in a block west of a long wall (x 98-101, z 48 to the map edge) are sent to a
# point beyond its top. The shortest ways all touch the wall end, so without
# the pinwheel the group files over it; gate.top.files_x100 is the files
# abreast over the end and side.east.t90 the source's rounded90 (90% at
# x >= 104).
# Speed 1.79999 builds the source's raw 117964 (1.8 rounds to 117965, which
# alone moves the whole run by ~3%). The gate is the runner's 8-cell strip
# (x 97-104, z 0-47) where the source counts x 97-102.
# Source numbers (main, offset 0): rounded90 1252, done 2284, files 4.48,
# spread 7.93, reversals 3.
name uturn
ticks 6000
probe lanes
seed 7
map flat 200 140
wall 98 48 4 92
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 48 rect 40 96 64 114 pitch=3
gate top 101 0 101 47
line east 104 0 104 140
at 1 move A 150 110
